/**
 * Interceptor that handles i18n locale resolution.
 * <p>
 * The {@code getLocaleFromParam} method has been hardened to prevent
 * injection attacks (e.g., XSS) by validating any locale supplied as a
 * {@code String}. Only well‑formed locale identifiers that match a strict
