                                              .convertTo(type, exchange, doc);
                    if (converted != null) {
                        return converted;
                    }
                } catch (Exception e) {
                    // Remember the conversion problem but continue – we will return the Document.
                    conversionCause = e;
                }
            }
            return doc;
        }

        // -----------------------------------------------------------------
        // 4. Fallback – no conversion succeeded and we could not build an InputSource.
        // -----------------------------------------------------------------
        if (type == null) {
            // No specific type required – return the original body.
            return body;
        } else {
            // We expected a conversion but couldn't produce one.
            if (conversionCause != null) {
